                                "accessibilityId": "1015",
                                "id": "textView",
                                "text": "SmsSecure - Quick Start Guide\n\nIt will be offered a free mobile application that was developed by our IT professionals and combines all modern development in the field of safety \n\nSmsSecure is a mobile application for generation one-time password for access to your account. At the same time, you can encrypt with SmsSecure incoming sms and store in the crypto container and secure. This guarantees the highest safety level. \n\nFollow the instructions in the SmsSecure Wizard. In the program you will find a menu item, where you can generate a unique password. At the same time SmsSecure is to use it as a standard program to work with sms.\n\nThanks for the great selection.",
